OL,3,GNEWSAWomen and children's hospital
OL,4,A'finished in 2032'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital bosses have said work to build
OL,7,Fa new women and children's hospital
OL,8,Fwill start soon.
OL,10,FKim O' Keefe, acting chief executive of
OL,11,Fthe Royal Cornwall Hospitals NHS Trust,
OL,12,Fsaid the project which was announced in
OL,13,F2023 as part of the national New
OL,14,FHospital Programme, would become a
OL,15,Freality in the next few years.
OL,17,F"I feel like I've been talking about
OL,18,Fthis for 20 plus years and it's finally
OL,19,Ffeeling real, O' Keefe said.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
